Is it really so?  The "r" is used vocalically here, and is unambiguously
so, since "trs" is not a valid consonant cluster.  Therefore the "r" must
be syllabic, and as such, according to the rule of da'amoi terbansa, it
would be TRSton. if not otherwise marked.

